{"name": "Super Alloy Crush", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/641afc681bed68973c846ae9a40285ee.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Ranger, the spaceship that allows our heroes to travel between planets. In the Super Alloy universe, everyone aboard the Ranger is on a mission to find the ultimate cosmic treasure planet AE-38.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Super Alloy universe, everyone aboard the Ranger is on a mission to find the ultimate cosmic treasure planet AE-38. And the obstacles and rivals along the way? Let the Cosmic Hunters Muu (Unit-02) and Kelly kick them straight into orbit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2D Fighting Action Game featuring Side-Scrolling and Roguelike combat.\u00a0Enjoy a visceral cosmic adventure where every punch lands hard\u2014team up for explosive Combo chains and unleash Overdrive Burst attacks to defeat powerful enemies. The two Cosmic Hunters are standing by for deployment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9b63d46482d1755ee007b66d23a77cdf.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9b63d46482d1755ee007b66d23a77cdf.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9b63d46482d1755ee007b66d23a77cdf.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/2b86374f9b1ff3e3d91b6d6bee781d22.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features the following core play modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode\uff5cExplore the treasure planet, unlocking the story and character mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Rush Mode\uff5cEvery run starts fresh! Build unstoppable power routes with hundreds of enhancements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimate Challenge\uff5cFace the hardest battles and prove your true strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/17362c222330e98b7ef66508a24b2837.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/17362c222330e98b7ef66508a24b2837.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/17362c222330e98b7ef66508a24b2837.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9861a9e0289ba08f4b26b6b51944347b.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Characters and Enhancements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u3010Core Experience\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become one of two uniquely skilled Cosmic Hunters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Muu \u2014 A close-combat robot fighter using energy claws, capable of agile movement to knock enemies into the air and chase them with continuous Combo attacks for massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kelly \u2014 An enhanced human specializing in firearms and tactical martial combat. A technical, high-skill character capable of commanding the battlefield entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V.T \u2014 An otherworldly visitor wielding runic swordsmanship and dark magic. A mid-to-close-range swordmaster built around the blade, capable of summoning otherworldly entities to assist in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6631f289600d4d4f4e00d0ebe20c573f.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6631f289600d4d4f4e00d0ebe20c573f.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/6631f289600d4d4f4e00d0ebe20c573f.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Build Customization\uff1a50+ combat Tech Arts \u00d7 Hundreds of Chips per character allow you to forge unique playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support System\uff1aRevive using portable recovery ship checkpoints + battlefield Support allies to turn the tide in desperate moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/0a18a14c51ff1883b58803d7a22ee52c.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/0a18a14c51ff1883b58803d7a22ee52c.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/0a18a14c51ff1883b58803d7a22ee52c.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/be6b735e9a252e210d379c686d99d00c.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battlefields &amp; Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize elemental offense to exploit weaknesses: Machines are vulnerable to electricity, and biological enemies fear fire. Gain combat advantage by using environmental objects!<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These powerful entities are equal in strength to the player characters. They can also accumulate energy and unleash Overdrive Burst attacks. To counter their powerful offensive, focus your attacks during the openings between their moves to break their 'Stance', interrupt their offense, and gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/291db2978ce3d40377f77ae50d0489e5.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rich Content &amp; Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 50+ Tech Arts and special actions per character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Customize performance via flexible Chip layouts \u2014 multi-air-jump / infinite energy / multiple HP layers, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Collect all Support allies to enhance tactical depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Dozens of enemy types and diverse BOSS encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Battle Rush Mode includes hundreds of upgrades for destructive power escalation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether playing solo or co-op, you\u2019ll enjoy fast-paced, thrilling action every time you start the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=\"1068\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Super Alloy Crush is a fast-paced 2D roguelike brawler inspired by classics like Mega Man X. Play as Kelly and Muu (No.02) to defeat enemies and obtain the ultimate cosmic treasure: Planet AE-38. Alone or with a friend in local co-op, get ready for your biggest challenge yet!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/6fb6ebbead0b01cf064cdde61304a3a5b1ff28f8/header.jpg?t=1784519208", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Side Scroller", "Pixel Graphics", "Female Protagonist", "Local Multiplayer", "Co-op"], "developers": "Alloy Mushroom", "publishers": "Alloy Mushroom", "release_date": "Apr 8, 2026", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "3092360", "review_type": "Recommended", "cura